    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Who said it?",
          "zh": "谁说它？",
          "startMs": 55630,
          "endMs": 57215
        },
        {
          "en": "To help the child find parts of the story where the characters are speaking.",
          "zh": "到帮助这孩子找到部分的这故事哪里这性格是说。",
          "startMs": 57215,
          "endMs": 67255
        },
        {
          "en": "Without showing the child, choose a page where someone is speaking.",
          "zh": "没有展示这孩子， 选择一个页哪里某人是说。",
          "startMs": 67255,
          "endMs": 76107
        },
        {
          "en": "Read what he/she said, e.",
          "zh": "读什么他/她说， 呃。",
          "startMs": 76107,
          "endMs": 79409
        },
        {
          "en": "\"What was that?\"",
          "zh": "什么是那个？",
          "startMs": 79409,
          "endMs": 81523
        },
        {
          "en": "(page 15).",
          "zh": "(页 15)。",
          "startMs": 81523,
          "endMs": 82844
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child to find the page and find out who said it.",
          "zh": "问这孩子到找到这页和找到出谁说它。",
          "startMs": 82844,
          "endMs": 90242
        },
        {
          "en": "Then let the child ask you to find out who said something else.",
          "zh": "然后让这孩子问你到找到出谁说某物其他。",
          "startMs": 90242,
          "endMs": 98565
        },
        {
          "en": "Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 98565,
          "endMs": 102396
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 102396,
          "endMs": 109926
        },
        {
          "en": "Take it in turns to read what each person says in the story.",
          "zh": "拿它在……里转动到读什么每个人说在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 109926,
          "endMs": 117852
        },
        {
          "en": "Remind the child that he/she should read only the text inside the speech marks.",
          "zh": "提醒这孩子那个他/她应该读只有这文本里面这说话能力斑点。",
          "startMs": 117852,
          "endMs": 128289
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child to draw a picture from the story, then put in a speech bubble next to a character.",
          "zh": "问这孩子到画一个图画从这故事， 然后放在……里一个说话能力泡泡下一个到一个性格。",
          "startMs": 128289,
          "endMs": 140971
        },
        {
          "en": "Then, in the bubble, help the child to write what the person said.",
